Title: The Bridge
Credit: Sample for Cinemafy
Author: Fallen Signal Studios

# ACT ONE

INT. FLAGSHIP BRIDGE - NIGHT

Red alert lights wash the bridge. KADE steps off the lift, wounded, one hand pressed to her side. She draws her pistol.

KADE
Stand down, Admiral.

ADMIRAL THANE
(not turning)
Make me.

Thane turns. He wears his dress uniform, medals and all.

INT. FLAGSHIP CORRIDOR - CONTINUOUS

Kade backs into the corridor, pistol up. Marines round the corner.

KADE
Nobody move!

FADE OUT.

# ACT TWO

EXT. HANGAR DECK - DAY

Thane picks up a saber from the weapons rack.

ADMIRAL THANE
You always did hesitate.

They fight. Kade vaults a cargo crate, Thane slashes, she rolls clear.

Kade kills Thane.

INT. MED BAY - LATER

Kade is patched up. She holsters her pistol.

KADE
It's done.

INT. FLAGSHIP BRIDGE - NIGHT

ADMIRAL THANE (V.O.)
You always did hesitate.

Kade looks at the empty command chair.
